.vscode/**
src/**
out/**/*.map
node_modules/**
# Except ws, which the browser tools need at run time.
#
# The extension had no dependencies at all, so excluding node_modules whole
# was free. Adding one and leaving this line alone would have shipped a build
# where the first use of open_browser died on "Cannot find module 'ws'" -
# found by checking what the package actually contains rather than by a user
# finding it. ws is 195 KB and has no dependencies of its own.
!node_modules/ws/**
tsconfig.json
.gitignore
test/**
